{"id":750,"name":"mudsdale","speciesId":750,"dex":750,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["ground"],"stats":{"hp":100,"attack":125,"defense":100,"special-attack":55,"special-defense":85,"speed":35},"abilities":[{"name":"own-tempo","hidden":false},{"name":"stamina","hidden":false},{"name":"inner-focus","hidden":true}],"height":25,"weight":9200,"baseExp":175,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/750.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/750.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/750.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/750.ogg","genus":"Draft Horse Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Cavalo de Draft","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"It spits a mud that provides resistance to both wind and rain, so the walls of old houses were often coated with it."},{"version":"moon","text":"Its heavy, mud-covered kicks are its best means of attack, and it can reduce large trucks to scrap without breaking a sweat."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It remains calm and unmoving no matter the situation. It mixes dirt with the saliva in its mouth to make a special kind of mud."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It can trudge mountain roads without rest for three days and three nights, all the while dragging a 10-ton load."},{"version":"sword","text":"Mud that hardens around a Mudsdale’s legs sets harder than stone. It’s so hard that it allows this Pokémon to scrap a truck with a single kick."},{"version":"shield","text":"Mudsdale has so much stamina that it could carry over 10 tons across the Galar region without rest or sleep."}],"flavorPt":"Mudsdale tem tanta resistência que poderia transportar mais de 10 toneladas pela região de Galar sem descansar ou dormir.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":60,"eggGroups":["ground"],"isLegendary":false,"isMyt